{"unit_id":"CaoNing3212__dsh-plugin-deepseek-balance#card-zh","repo":"CaoNing3212/dsh-plugin-deepseek-balance","commit":"0d712aca6cb4259655ff861a4c3fcced77a54715","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-deepseek-balance 是 DSH Web 插件，在输入框下方显示 DeepSeek 官方账户余额。主机端通过凭据服务或启动环境读取 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY，并请求 /user/balance；客户端格式化展示余额，CNY 使用 ¥ 标记。点击余额可刷新。未配置密钥、使用代理地址或查询失败时不显示。适合希望在 DSH 会话中查看官方 API 余额的用户，需配置 DeepSeek API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77-124","lib/client.js:66-116"]}
{"unit_id":"CaoNing3212__dsh-plugin-deepseek-balance#card-en","repo":"CaoNing3212/dsh-plugin-deepseek-balance","commit":"0d712aca6cb4259655ff861a4c3fcced77a54715","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-deepseek-balance shows the DeepSeek official account balance in the DSH Web composer dock. It reads DEEPSEEK_API_KEY and calls /user/balance, formats currencies, and refreshes when clicked. The display is hidden if the key is missing, a proxy is used, or the request fails.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77-124","lib/client.js:66-116"]}
